    "qnum": "A2",
    "question": "You are Rinhlua, living at Raven Colony, Chandmari, Aizawl. You purchased a washing machine last\n   week from M.S. Stores, at Aizawl Bazaar, but it was not working properly when brought home.\n   Write a complaint letter to the dealer to raise the issue regarding the same, with necessary details.\n                                                                                                     (10)",
